{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606820/extras/\u56fe\u7247_20250326102317.jpg?t=1744106018\" />This is a fun time-killer simulator inspired by the classic ring toss game from childhood. Players control a fan to precisely toss objects into baskets. The game offers several unique modes, including a Relaxation mode and a Challenge mode, bringing different levels of fun and challenge. The Relaxation mode lets you enjoy the game at a leisurely pace, while the Challenge mode offers higher difficulty to test your skills. The realistic physics engine makes every action surprising and enhances the fun of controlling. Whether you're relaxing or competing with friends, this game brings endless joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game\u2019s style pays homage to early retro arcade machines, complemented by soothing jazz music, immersing players in a relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere to fully unwind and enjoy every moment of fun.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606820/extras/\u56fe\u7247_20250326102944.jpg?t=1744106018\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606820?t=1744106018","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606820/48654ebec8dd611af0f3799735d1dd00cba49c81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744106018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606820/1003947ad1fa64e535e0e801724c5c3b10ff52da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744106018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606820/1003947ad1fa64e535e0e801724c5c3b10ff52da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744106018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"c